          "intro": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "For Stephan Eicher und die Automaten, the Swiss singer-songwriter is alone on stage with a band of automated acoustic instruments. We built several of those instruments and orchestrion units, for different productions of the show.",
