      {
        "variation": "default",
        "version": "initial",
        "items": [],
        "primary": {
          "eyebrow": "The brief",
          "title": "Instruments that follow the singer",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Stephan Eicher's songs needed instruments with dynamics. Instruments that only switch notes on and off could not follow him. Ours play every note with its own velocity, so the automated band follows the song.",
              "spans": []
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "The show toured widely, from the Bardentreffen festival in Nuremberg to the Rockhal in Esch-sur-Alzette, and the instruments travelled with it: set up, played and packed again in a different venue each time.",
              "spans": []
            }
          ],
